#. <CLT 4>これは…モノクマの像か…
#. 事件には関係ないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the statue of Monokuma. It has nothing to do with\n"
"the case...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは…ビーナス像か…
#. 美術室らしいな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's...a Venus statue. Exactly the kind of thing you'd\n"
"find in an art room...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>特に気になる事はないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think there's anything important here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>壁一面に絵が張られている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are paintings lining the walls.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>特に気になる事はないな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think there's anything important here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって、仁王像だよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is a statue of Nio.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>事件には関係なさそうだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Doesn't seem related to the case...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ロッカーがある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The locker...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>中は空だし、気になる物はないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's empty inside, so I can forget about it for now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
